Implement a 16-input AND gate that produces a single output. The module takes a 16-bit input (IN1) and performs a hierarchical series of AND operations, ultimately producing a 16-bit output (Y) that represents the AND of all input bits. The design cascades multiple levels of AND gates to compute the final result, ensuring that Y will only be high if all individual bits of IN1 are high.
