Design a four-bit comparator that outputs a HIGH signal when the four-bit input A is greater than the four-bit input B. If A is less than or equal to B, the output will be LOW. This module continuously evaluates the inputs, making it suitable for real-time comparisons in digital systems.
module top_module(
  input [3:0] A,
